# General standards

A product rule in this folder overrides this file when it names a path, a store, or a domain invariant.

`any` is a P0 violation. Use `unknown` and a type guard. Catch blocks are `catch (error: unknown)`. Dictionaries are `Record<string, unknown>`.

- Every component exports a props interface. Include `className?` and merge it with `cn()`.
- Shared types and Zod schemas live in `types/[feature]/`. Infer with `z.infer<typeof schema>`. Do not declare entity types inside components, hooks, or services.
- Shared UI is generic and lives in `components/shared/` or `components/common/`. A second copy of date, error, or list logic goes to `lib/utils/` first.
- Log with the project logger. Do not call `console.*`.
- Every create, update, and delete tells the user it succeeded or failed. Do not fail silently.

| Priority | Blocks merge when |
| --- | --- |
| P0 | `any`, `console.*`, a screen calling the network, a secret in the repo, unvalidated input, string-built SQL |
| P1 | Duplicated logic, a local entity type, a missing loading, empty, or error state |
| P2 | Naming, polish, non-blocking docs |

Layouts work at 360px with no horizontal scroll. Use the project's breakpoints. New env vars go in `.env.example` and are validated at startup.
